Next, the workflow automatically converts the fields to the appropriate data types, such as integers, dates, and strings, based on the data being loaded.
It then validates the required columns and applies business formatting rules. For example, the Contract PBP field is formatted to always contain three digits by adding leading zeros where necessary.
