"The Auto Field tool analyzes the dataset and assigns the most appropriate data types and field sizes to optimize storage and improve performance."
Step 5 – Select Tool
"The Select tool reviews the schema, confirms the data types, and keeps only the required columns for loading."
Step 6 – Data Cleansing
"The Data Cleansing tool removes leading and trailing spaces, duplicate whitespace, and other unwanted characters to improve data quality."
Step 7 – Business Rule
"A Formula tool formats the Contract PBP value by adding leading zeros where needed so that all values follow the required three-digit format."
Step 8 – Load to Snowflake
"Finally, the Output Data tool uses the Snowflake Bulk Loader to append the cleansed records into the Campaign Target table in Snowflake."
